WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.153
- Are you breastfeeding?

00:00:01.153 --> 00:00:02.153
- [Man] Yes.

00:00:03.990 --> 00:00:06.573
(upbeat music)

00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:10.988
- My name is Colette Wiseman.

00:00:10.988 --> 00:00:13.011
I'm a ER physician

00:00:13.011 --> 00:00:14.703
and also a lactation counselor.

00:00:14.703 --> 00:00:16.499
I go out to new mom's houses

00:00:16.499 --> 00:00:17.789
and help them with breastfeeding.

00:00:17.789 --> 00:00:19.564
Most of it's really just reassuring moms

00:00:19.564 --> 00:00:20.562
that they're doing it right

00:00:20.562 --> 00:00:22.520
and that the baby is getting enough milk

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:25.549
and answering some basic
questions about timing

00:00:25.549 --> 00:00:27.324
and what's normal in a newborn.

00:00:27.324 --> 00:00:29.064
I'm here today to assist and guide

00:00:29.064 --> 00:00:31.575
two men who are gonna try out Mamabreast,

00:00:31.575 --> 00:00:32.605
even though they're men

00:00:32.605 --> 00:00:36.772
they're gonna be simulating
what it's like to breastfeed.

00:00:40.565 --> 00:00:43.322
- I feel like I know a decent
amount about breastfeeding.

00:00:43.322 --> 00:00:45.011
I know that there's a lot
of nutrients in the milk,

00:00:45.011 --> 00:00:47.011
I know that there's actually no age

00:00:47.011 --> 00:00:48.743
to ever stop breastfeeding,

00:00:48.743 --> 00:00:50.833
it's just a societal
thing that people make you

00:00:50.833 --> 00:00:51.863
feel like you need to stop

00:00:51.863 --> 00:00:53.227
drinking breast milk at a certain age.

00:00:53.227 --> 00:00:55.049
I mean you can't be like 35 and be like,

00:00:55.049 --> 00:00:56.039
"Gimme some of that breast milk."

00:00:56.039 --> 00:00:57.339
- What I know about breastfeeding is that

00:00:57.339 --> 00:00:58.578
it's a necessity for the baby,

00:00:58.578 --> 00:01:02.296
and I know that it could
be uncomfortable for women

00:01:02.296 --> 00:01:06.046
because, you know, your
breasts are on large.

00:01:08.687 --> 00:01:09.520
- Woahoho!

00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:12.449
This is what I'm gonna have to wear?

00:01:12.449 --> 00:01:14.919
- Yeah, this is gonna
simulate breastfeeding.

00:01:14.919 --> 00:01:16.384
- I have to wear this the whole day?

00:01:16.384 --> 00:01:18.331
- And I just throw this up over my--

00:01:18.331 --> 00:01:19.884
- Yep, just goes on--

00:01:19.884 --> 00:01:21.272
- Should I turn off the valves?

00:01:21.272 --> 00:01:22.701
- No, leave them on.
- Leave them on? Okay.

00:01:22.701 --> 00:01:23.848
- It's fine, they don't leak.

00:01:23.848 --> 00:01:24.777
(laughs)

00:01:24.777 --> 00:01:28.776
- It already feels weird
on my neck and on my back.

00:01:28.776 --> 00:01:30.914
- If you're going to
simulate expressing milk,

00:01:30.914 --> 00:01:32.073
like if your baby is having trouble

00:01:32.073 --> 00:01:33.791
actually latching on to the breast,

00:01:33.791 --> 00:01:37.327
what you need to do is cup
your hand under the breast,

00:01:37.327 --> 00:01:39.451
you're not gonna cover
the area under the nipple,

00:01:39.451 --> 00:01:41.764
but you're gonna cup
under kind of in a C-shape

00:01:41.764 --> 00:01:45.852
and express gently, like
it's a water balloon.

00:01:45.852 --> 00:01:47.453
- [Curly] Oh-ho-ho!

00:01:47.453 --> 00:01:48.904
- [Colette] Yeah, see you
have to hit that magic spot,

00:01:48.904 --> 00:01:51.113
it's not just a matter of
grabbing and squeezing.

00:01:51.113 --> 00:01:52.982
You're gonna actually move baby

00:01:52.982 --> 00:01:55.407
so that it's nose is at the nipple

00:01:55.407 --> 00:01:59.101
and baby is gonna move his
head back, or her head back,

00:01:59.101 --> 00:02:00.791
and latch on like that.

00:02:00.791 --> 00:02:03.790
- I have to feed a baby
every few hours now.

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:07.250
- Well, after newborns will
feed more than every few hours.

00:02:07.250 --> 00:02:08.738
If they're getting formula,

00:02:08.738 --> 00:02:10.500
they'll usually feed every three hours,

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:13.114
but if they're breastfed they
might wanna go on every hour.

00:02:13.114 --> 00:02:14.653
- [Zach] That's a lot to remember, but

00:02:14.653 --> 00:02:15.684
I'm ready to do this.

00:02:15.684 --> 00:02:16.607
- And so it begins.

00:02:16.607 --> 00:02:18.665
I'm actually wearing my

00:02:18.665 --> 00:02:20.377
blazer the opposite way

00:02:20.377 --> 00:02:23.145
because I don't wanna look (laughs)

00:02:23.145 --> 00:02:23.978
- It's cold, guys.
- Cold.

00:02:23.978 --> 00:02:24.812
- It's real cold.

00:02:24.812 --> 00:02:27.849
- I kept bringing them up
to kind of relieve my neck

00:02:27.849 --> 00:02:29.739
of the weight of it

00:02:29.739 --> 00:02:31.618
and that's what helped,

00:02:31.618 --> 00:02:33.578
And the ladies next to me were cracking up

00:02:33.578 --> 00:02:35.521
'cause they were saying
sometimes that's what they do.

00:02:35.521 --> 00:02:36.521
- Is it heavy?

00:02:36.521 --> 00:02:37.377
How much do they weigh?

00:02:37.377 --> 00:02:38.210
- [Curly] It is heavy.

00:02:38.210 --> 00:02:39.253
It definitely feels like

00:02:39.253 --> 00:02:40.901
you can kind of rest it on something.

00:02:40.901 --> 00:02:43.382
- See, I do that all the time!

00:02:43.382 --> 00:02:45.223
- [Woman] Are they heavy?

00:02:45.223 --> 00:02:46.314
- Yeah, I've noticed like my neck,

00:02:46.314 --> 00:02:47.795
the back of my neck is hurting.

00:02:47.795 --> 00:02:50.795
- [Woman] Wow, welcome to womanhood.

00:02:51.940 --> 00:02:53.511
(laughs)

00:02:53.511 --> 00:02:54.857
- [Woman] Does it feel
weird having to, like,

00:02:54.857 --> 00:02:56.143
do it every so often?

00:02:56.143 --> 00:02:58.431
- It feels weird having to do it a lot,

00:02:58.431 --> 00:03:01.303
'cuz I'm like in the middle
of something and I forget

00:03:01.303 --> 00:03:03.193
and I'm like, oh, it's time already?

00:03:03.193 --> 00:03:06.795
- I couldn't get into a work rhythm.

00:03:06.795 --> 00:03:09.400
Every time I would
finally get into a flow of

00:03:09.400 --> 00:03:10.732
doing whatever I was doing at work,

00:03:10.732 --> 00:03:13.083
my alarm would go off telling
me I have to breastfeed,

00:03:13.083 --> 00:03:15.373
or I'd have to dispose into a cup.

00:03:15.373 --> 00:03:19.540
It's now 3:15, and I have to
extract milk from my breast.

00:03:21.175 --> 00:03:22.008
Fun times.

00:03:24.776 --> 00:03:27.347
- Is that bad that I skipped two feedings?

00:03:27.347 --> 00:03:28.182
- Yes!

00:03:28.182 --> 00:03:29.913
- I don't have a problem with
somebody else breastfeeding,

00:03:29.913 --> 00:03:32.182
but I did feel weird about
people looking at me.

00:03:32.182 --> 00:03:34.150
I actually avoided leaving the studio.

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:36.150
I was scared to be stared at.

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:37.752
I was worried that if my alarm went off

00:03:37.752 --> 00:03:38.881
and my baby got hungry

00:03:38.881 --> 00:03:40.866
that I would not be in a place

00:03:40.866 --> 00:03:44.033
that was private enough to breastfeed.

00:03:48.593 --> 00:03:52.510
- Is this wrong to be
eating while he's eating?

00:03:53.649 --> 00:03:55.191
Came down,

00:03:55.191 --> 00:03:57.467
saw Curly sitting here.

00:03:57.467 --> 00:03:58.995
Boobies out, no baby.

00:03:58.995 --> 00:04:00.398
(laughter)

00:04:00.398 --> 00:04:01.902
This was a dark awakening into a future

00:04:01.902 --> 00:04:03.696
I feel if I have like a daughter.

00:04:03.696 --> 00:04:05.972
Like I don't think I'd
want to have a daughter.

00:04:05.972 --> 00:04:08.005
Like I'm hoping I don't, for her sake.

00:04:08.005 --> 00:04:10.203
'Cause I don't think this is a good look

00:04:10.203 --> 00:04:11.270
for a female me.

00:04:11.270 --> 00:04:13.966
- How does this experience make you feel?

00:04:13.966 --> 00:04:14.983
- Can I be honest?

00:04:14.983 --> 00:04:16.996
It's really bothersome.

00:04:16.996 --> 00:04:19.321
I haven't got--
- I feel that way about boobs.

00:04:19.321 --> 00:04:20.800
- Yes, well the boobs is a separate issue.

00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:21.781
- [Woman] How you feelin', Talita?

00:04:21.781 --> 00:04:23.142
- I feel good.
- Yeah?

00:04:23.142 --> 00:04:24.650
- I was talking about earlier,

00:04:24.650 --> 00:04:27.451
how I didn't feel really
comfortable going out

00:04:27.451 --> 00:04:29.208
because I feel like I'd get anxiety

00:04:29.208 --> 00:04:30.610
about just going to the market.

00:04:30.610 --> 00:04:32.688
Like, I'm like, oh, I
gotta go to the market

00:04:32.688 --> 00:04:34.129
and then I get anxious and I'm like,

00:04:34.129 --> 00:04:36.268
I can't imagine having to then

00:04:36.268 --> 00:04:38.637
think about breastfeeding
at the market, too.

00:04:38.637 --> 00:04:40.015
You know, like, I can't imagine

00:04:40.015 --> 00:04:44.979
what that anxiety must be
like for women to just be...

00:04:44.979 --> 00:04:46.224
They can't just go to the market,

00:04:46.224 --> 00:04:47.751
they have to worry about feeding somebody

00:04:47.751 --> 00:04:49.883
and they can't not feed their baby,

00:04:49.883 --> 00:04:50.972
they have to feed the baby,

00:04:50.972 --> 00:04:52.572
so this is already,

00:04:52.572 --> 00:04:54.293
it gave me a little bit
more self-conscience

00:04:54.293 --> 00:04:56.749
in the way that I imagine
a lot of women feel.

00:04:56.749 --> 00:04:58.289
- I think this was an
interesting experience

00:04:58.289 --> 00:05:00.175
to something that I had no idea experience

00:05:00.175 --> 00:05:01.008
of like what it's like,

00:05:01.008 --> 00:05:02.800
you know, because I'm
obviously not a woman,

00:05:02.800 --> 00:05:06.070
and I'm never opposed to a
woman breastfeeding in public,

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:08.662
but this just made me feel

00:05:08.662 --> 00:05:09.950
the trials and tribulations to go through.

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:13.320
- People don't like seeing
boobs for their function,

00:05:13.320 --> 00:05:15.318
because they are sexualized.

00:05:15.318 --> 00:05:18.721
So, I think if they can
somehow understand that

00:05:18.721 --> 00:05:21.171
it's, you know, it's a little bit of both.

00:05:21.171 --> 00:05:22.616
You know, if you like
boobs, you like boobs,

00:05:22.616 --> 00:05:24.678
but boobs also do more.

00:05:24.678 --> 00:05:27.739
They act as more than just
something that turns you on.

00:05:27.739 --> 00:05:28.572
Like, they bring life.

00:05:28.572 --> 00:05:30.085
They're part of a human being as well.

00:05:30.085 --> 00:05:32.448
I commend women all the time, like,

00:05:32.448 --> 00:05:36.259
y'all make things look easier
than they actually are.

00:05:36.259 --> 00:05:37.194
I mean big ups to you,

00:05:37.194 --> 00:05:40.612
you birth life and then
you nurture it, like,

00:05:40.612 --> 00:05:42.112
that's girl power.

